EasyTier-Web - Docker packaging
===============================

This repository contains Docker packaging (Dockerfile, entrypoint, compose
files, scripts, documentation) around the EasyTier binaries. The packaging
itself is provided as-is, without warranty of any kind.

Bundled third-party software
----------------------------

app/server/easytier-core
app/server/easytier-web-embed

are prebuilt binaries of EasyTier, version 2.4.5, taken unmodified from the
fnOS package at https://github.com/FNOSP/App.Bin.EasyTier-Web .

EasyTier is Copyright (C) its authors and is licensed under the
GNU Lesser General Public License v3.0 (LGPL-3.0).
See https://github.com/EasyTier/EasyTier for the full license text and
corresponding source code.

The original fnOS package sources are kept under fnos/ for reference.
